1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,400
Then the taps cough and go dry. Forty-
one kids. No water.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,833
The tank on the roof. Mister Frank
says it's only for emergencies.

3
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:09,433
Define emergency.

4
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:16,433
The roof. Rain tank, half full.
Leaves. A dead pigeon. Below you, a
tiny red dot: Mia's truck, at the
line.

5
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:21,633
Rule six. Boil it before anyone drinks
it. A full rolling boil, one minute.

6
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:24,300
I can see you! Wave if you still have
puffs!

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,333
Two!

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,000
You have one. You lie. It's the first
lie you've told her.
